    },
    faq: {
      title: "Frequently asked questions",
      items: [
        { q: "How is AI consulting different from an AI agency?", a: "A classic consultancy tells you what to do and leaves. We diagnose, prioritize and also build: the same team that defines the strategy takes it to production. We explain it in detail in <a href='/en/blog/what-is-an-ai-agency/' class='text-orange-400 hover:underline'>what is an AI agency</a>." },
        { q: "Do you only deliver strategy or also implement?", a: "Both. Consulting ends in an actionable roadmap, and we can execute it ourselves — agents, automation and integrations. See our <a href='/en/servicios/agencia-ia/' class='text-orange-400 hover:underline'>AI agency</a> service." },
